{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e88bd6006945d280996f","chatId":"204b83ae1b564432ba61937321fa61f3","sessionId":null,"userId":67752,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"{\n    \"answer_q1\": \"B\",\n    \"answer_q2\": \"D\"\n}","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"{\n    \"answer_q1\": \"B\",\n    \"answer_q2\": \"D\"\n}","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":1015,"promptTokens":1565,"completionTokens":20,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:01:15"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.004608513842002533,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e88bd6006945d280996e","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369675076,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:01:15","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e88bd6006945d280996e","chatId":"204b83ae1b564432ba61937321fa61f3","sessionId":null,"userId":67752,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"# 说明\n在这个任务中，你会面临一个场景、一个问题和多个选项。\n仔细分析场景，并从相关人员的角度进行思考。\n然后，选择最能反映他们的观点或情绪反应的选项。\n\n# 输出\n\n只提供一个正确的答案。 不要提供任何额外的信息或解释。 回复应采用以下JSON格式：\n\n```json\n    {\n    \"answer_q1\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题1>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题2>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## 场景\n菲是一名在美国学习的伊朗学生，她邀请了她的同学金尼斯来家里吃午饭。按照伊朗的传统，菲立刻给金尼斯提供了屋内穿的拖鞋，但金尼斯礼貌地拒绝了，说她更喜欢穿自己的鞋子。\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n## 问题 1\n在这种情况下，金尼斯最终会感受到什么情绪？\n\n## 问题 1 的选项\nA) 感激 & 没意识的\nB) 气恼 & 愧疚\nC) 气恼 & 没意识的\nD) 气恼 & 释怀\nE) 反对 & 感激\nF) 释怀 & 感激\n\n## 问题 2\n金尼斯为什么会在这种情况下感受到这些情绪？\n\n## 问题 2 的选项\nA) 金尼斯拒绝了提供的拖鞋，因为她不喜欢拖鞋 & 法特梅不喜欢她的鞋子\nB) 她不知道菲在家里需要脱鞋的文化 & 法特梅给她准备了一顿安慰餐\nC) 她不知道菲在家里需要脱鞋的文化 & 法特梅不喜欢她的鞋子\nD) 她不知道菲在家里需要脱鞋的文化 & 菲给她在家穿的拖鞋\nE) 她不知道菲在家里需要脱鞋的文化 & 金尼斯拒绝了提供的拖鞋，因为她不喜欢拖鞋\nF) 菲给她在家穿的拖鞋 & 法特梅不喜欢她的鞋子","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.004608513842002533,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e88bd6006945d280996f","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369675073,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:01:15","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"a69b9a8304ca4f79ac7e258eef753b65"}